# The proxy of the ha repository's recovery ssh path (its docs/recovery.md),
# which calls it as `cloudflared access ssh`. A program, so Homebrew owns it
# (constitution principle II), not mise.
brew "cloudflared"
# The decompiler REA drives (see mcp.json). The bottle builds the native
# decompiler for arm64 and brings openjdk@21, which Ghidra runs on.
brew "ghidra"
